  "title": "关于开展2026秋季学期克隆班对外合作课程申报工作的通知",
  "date": "20260618",
  "time": "2026-06-18 15:56",
  "category": "教务通知",
  "department": "教务处",
  "sourceId": "tsinghua-info-all",
  "sourceName": "清华信息门户",
  "source": "清华信息门户",
  "sourceUrl": "https://info.tsinghua.edu.cn/f/info/xxfb_fg/xnzx/template/detail?xxid=cedc643206b449b2b661665e9d3b0d07",
  "summary": "",
  "preview": "",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">为进一步促进我校信息技术与教育教学的深度融合，推动构建更开放、更融合、更有韧性的大学，<a name=\"_Hlk119416113\">更新教育理念、变革教育模式</a>，现开展2026年秋季学期克隆班对外合作课程申报遴选工作。通过申报的课程，将经由雨课堂克隆班，实时在线开放学期内全部的校内课堂教学内容给限定范围内的国内高校师生观摩旁听。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">一、申报范围</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">秋季学期学校将经由克隆班对外校师生开放约50门课程，申报面向校内所有院系本、研课程。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">二、申报条件</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、鼓励人工智能赋能教学试点课程参与申报。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、申报课程一般为专业基础课或通识课，以课堂讲授为主，中文授课，课程原则上应在校内已连续开设不少于2学期，校内学生评教结果良好。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、申报课程的课程内容不得存在科学性和思想性问题，定位准确，教学内容质量高，课程知识体系和教学设计科学完整。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、申报课程的授课教师须在授课过程中开启雨课堂直播功能，指导助教对观摩教师进行有针对性的答疑和教研等活动、开展有针对性的过程性考核和期末考核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">三、学校政策支持</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">为配合课程开放工作，为每门课程配备一个校设助教名额。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">四、申报工作流程</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">非首次参加的教师，请填写附件1《清华大学克隆班对外合作课程备案表》；</span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">首次申报的教师，请填写附件2《清华大学克隆班对外合作课程申报表》，院系教学主管对本院系首次申报的课程进行审核。请院系汇总后，于2026年6月29日17：00前将本院系的备案表的word版、申报表的word版和签字盖章后的电子扫描版发送至邮箱xingxd@tsinghua.edu.cn。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">如有问题，请联系在线教育中心邢晓丹，电话：94635/ 18612464050</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\">                                                                           </span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">教务处</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">研究生院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年6月18日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">附件1：</span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">清华大学克隆班对外合作课程备案表（非初次申报教师填写）</span></span></b></span></span></p> \n <table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none\" width=\"626\"> \n  <tbody> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px; width:131px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:2px; border-right:1px; border-left:2px\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">课程名称</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td colspan=\"8\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:492px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:2px solid black; border-right:2px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:none; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none; width:3px\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"> </span></span></p> </td> \n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:131px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:2px solid black\"> <p style=\"margin-top:16px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">课程负责人</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:66px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">姓名</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:132px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> </td> \n    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:85px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">职称</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:208px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:2px solid black; border-left:none\"> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:none; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none; width:3px\">